  "description": "Reads a DeepSharp pipeline's rows out of a folder of pictures, a folder to each class: .ReadImages(path, shape) in the chain, read.images in a pipeline file, replayed like any other file the pipeline reads. PNG, JPEG, BMP, GIF and TGA, each file a row whose pixels are one cell of a fixed size and a fixed number of channels that the step says — a picture of another size is refused and never resized — and the class the name of its folder, with a column of nought and one for each class a learner is handed the answer by.",
